Read/action commands:

DELete...........Remove the message from your In-Basket.
FORward [name]...Forward the message to [name].
Help.............Display this message
REPly............Start a new message to the sender of the
                 message you have just read.
ORIGinal.........If you have just read a reply to a message
                 this displays the original message.
LEave............Leave the message in the In-Basket, return
                 to Mail.
Quit.............Same as Leave.



